User-System Interaction Flow:
-> User enters a complex question into the React frontend.
-> The LangGraph Agent analyzes the query intent.
-> The system retrieves ~100 documents using pgvector and BM25.
-> The Cross-Encoder re-ranks to find the absolute best 10 documents.
-> The LLM reads the 10 documents and synthesizes a cited answer.
-> The user sees the answer and a visual Knowledge Graph.
-> As the user clicks documents, the backend updates their taste vector.
